node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
*.local
*.log

# SvelteKit intermediate output (created by `vite build` before
# adapter-static emits to dist/). Not used by the Go binary.
build/

# Real SvelteKit build output (code-split JS/CSS chunks + the
# favicon Vite copies from src/). Regenerated on every
# `npm run build` so tracking them would churn git history
# without adding any review value. The Go embed pulls them in
# at compile time.
dist/_app/
dist/favicon.svg

# `dist/index.html` is intentionally TRACKED so the binary
# embeds something even on a fresh checkout that hasn't run
# `npm run build` yet (the embed would otherwise fail with
# "no matching files found" on Go 1.21+ which respects
# .gitignore for embed patterns). The placeholder commits
# here gets overwritten by the real SvelteKit build output
# on every `make web-frontend-build`.
